                                                "sense_id": "ddb16c57-2c53-3686-abaf-1c9b4fb981c3",
                                                "text": "Two floors above, a young Sellafield employee sat in a gaming chair, working at a laptop with a joystick. He was manoeuvring an ROV fitted with a toilet brush – “a regular brush, bought at the store,” he said, “just kind of reinforced with a bit of plastic tube”."
